@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:5112

### 1. Login via Gateway → redirige vers Identity.API
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "oumaima@test.com",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

### 2. Récupérer les ressources via Gateway → redirige vers Catalog.API
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/resources
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..VqFFRTaJmBavnO9XKS3rqm_W2cNqkMJAnS82VwMNJb4

### 3. Créer une réservation via Gateway → redirige vers Booking.API
@timeout=60000
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..VqFFRTaJmBavnO9XKS3rqm_W2cNqkMJAnS82VwMNJb4

{
  "resourceId": "646fb5a1-dc27-48d3-aa4c-996ed422c640",
  "userId": "afe985b4-7844-485b-bd36-ddb84573bea7",
  "startTime": "2026-07-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-07-01T12:00:00Z"
}

### 4. Tester Rate Limiting — envoyer 101 fois la même requête
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/resources
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..VqFFRTaJmBavnO9XKS3rqm_W2cNqkMJAnS82VwMNJb4

### 5. Tester sans token → doit retourner 401
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/resources